@media(max-width: 390px){.owner-layout{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px}.owner-sidebar{flex:1 1 100%;max-width:none}.owner-nav{flex-direction:row;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap}.owner-main{flex:1 1 100%;padding:16px}.card-grid,.stat-grid,.storage-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.collection-steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.page-header{flex-wrap:wrap}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}}
</style></head><body><div class="owner-layout"><aside class="owner-sidebar"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>AI Bridge</div><p class="owner-eyebrow">Owner console</p><nav class="owner-nav" aria-label="Owner navigation"><a href="/owner/clients">Clients</a><a href="/owner/measurements?format=html" aria-current="page">Measurements</a><a href="/owner/exports">Exports</a><a href="/owner/blob-gc">Blob collection</a></nav><section class="owner-service"><h2>Service</h2><p><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Service metadata unknown</p></section></aside><main class="owner-main"><header class="page-header"><div><p class="owner-eyebrow">Observability</p><h1>Service measurements</h1><p>UTC window: 2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-08T00:00:00.000Z. Client coverage: partial. Observed from Unknown through Unknown.</p></div><span class="chip">Fresh or stale: stale</span></header><p class="measurement-note">Requests are observed lower bounds, not billing totals. Request observation window: Unknown to Unknown. Latency: observed, fresh.</p><p><a href="/owner/measurements">Measurement JSON</a></p><section class="stat-grid" aria-label="Request and feed measurements"><article class="card"><p class="label">REST requests</p><p class="stat-value">8</p><p class="footnote">Observed lower bound. Request data: observed, stale.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="label">MCP requests</p><p class="stat-value">4</p><p class="footnote">Observed lower bound. Request data: observed, stale.</p></article><article class="card card-highlight"><p class="label">Feed response preparation p95</p><p class="stat-value">Unknown<span class="unit"> milliseconds</span></p><p class="footnote">Feed response preparation p95: Unknown milliseconds. Boundary: authenticated router entry to successful /v1/changes response headers. This excludes lazy body production, network transfer, plugin apply, and publication delay.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="label">Retained samples</p><p class="stat-value">2 of 3</p><p class="footnote">Retained samples: 2 of 3. Retained sample window: Unknown to Unknown. Earlier samples were removed by the daily cap.</p></article></section><section class="storage-grid" aria-label="Storage and isolate measurements"><article class="card"><p class="label">Durable Object SQLite bytes</p><p class="stat-value">Unknown (storage_error)</p><div class="storage-bar storage-unknown" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="footnote">DO SQLite allocated bytes: Unknown (storage_error). No capacity is inferred.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="label">Referenced R2 blob bytes</p><p class="stat-value">2048</p><div class="storage-bar storage-observed" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="footnote">Referenced R2 blob bytes: 2048. Referenced R2 bytes count distinct blobs, not total bucket allocation.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="label">Isolate read slots</p><p class="stat-value">Held 2 of 4</p><div class="slot-segments" aria-label="2 of 4 read slots held"><span class="slot-segment slot-held" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="slot-segment slot-held" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="slot-segment" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="slot-segment" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><p class="footnote">Responding Worker isolate isolate-1: 2 active read slots, 2 available, limit 4. Hold deadline: 1000 ms. Incomplete read responses that reached the lease deadline since isolate start: 1. This isolate-local observation resets on restart and does not describe other isolates or prove physical source work stopped.</p></article></section><section class="panel"><h2>Observed clients</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Observed client</th><th>REST</th><th>MCP</th><th>Total</th><th>Last feed request</th><th>Observed poll interval</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>client&lt;&amp;: REST 8, MCP 4, total 12</td><td>8</td><td>4</td><td>12</td><td>Unknown</td><td>unknown (out-of-order requests)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p><a href="/owner/clients">Connected clients</a></p></main></div></body></html>"
`;

exports[`owner page rendering > renders the shared owner shell 1`] = `
